        "Shuddering explosions rock the base,\rfire blossoms throughout every\rdoorway.\r\r",
        "Everywhere walls and supports buckle\rand crumble in the explosions.\r\r\r",
        "Debris and shrapnel fly everywhere\rkilling everything it touches.\r\r\r",
        "You can almost imagine robots\rscreaming as they realize they, too,\rare mortal.\r\r",
        "\u000b was killed in the blast.\r\r\r",
        "\r  \"But certainly most important of all were the rangers who gave their lives to destroy Base Cochise, the greatest threat that man has ever known.\"\r",
